87", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41775228", "author": {"steamid": "76561198129568100", "personaname": "Mr Andrew bauuusak", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198129568100/", "num_games_owned": 33, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 29301, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3685, "last_played": 1763844319, "avatar": "613235828260404b6a39ccb7d788486cac896aab"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game have originality, and its very fun playing with friends. But it can be much more fun if further ideas invested. \nMy suggestion: -Add a giant boss that is so hard and huge to defeat that sometimes its better to avoid (turning off the lights and hidding)    -Add another mode for p v p (see whos faster collecting resources or leader board)   -Add more upgradables: your own space home above the surface? \nBut overall cant complant much, just need more upgrades for getting players engaging longer time.\n", "timestamp_created": 1525098397, "timestamp_updated": 1525098397, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41772800", "author": {"steamid": "76561198108170242", "personaname": "GS", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198108170242/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 81, "playtime_forever": 1768, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 747, "last_played": 1588101552, "avatar": "96fa7f84d239fdc1dbdbf795e3121d95447dce9b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really good game. Graphics are great, the gameplay is awesome. I do find it rare to have games now a days that arent mass multiplayer and that you have to work as a team or else you die, and your team also. \n\nFair enough, when connecting with my friend, I do seem to lag a fair bit in the main room but in the mission its fine. \n\nBut overall, it is a nice game even though if you watch my video down below, you will see that Bosco was completely useless near the end of my solo match:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/6PuXcC7xMCA\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1525088403, "timestamp_updated": 1525088403, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41772475", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974936536", "personaname": "Private Ticklemoort II", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974936536/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1061, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 972, "last_played": 1708527460, "avatar": "653e9d7de6593a2f95adfb483b77cde072d43d2a"}, "language": "english", "review": "6 minute video review here:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EkzGzfkYD0A&t\n\nThis game is fantastic.", "timestamp_created": 1525087058, "timestamp_updated": 1525087058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}